      "depictstmsobjectid": "55035",
      "assistivetext": "The image shows a man from mid-chest upwards. He is facing forward but slightly turned to his right. The man has a round face with a prominent nose and full lips. He has thick, curly hair extending down to his shoulders. He wears a formal robe with a wide, white collar. Surrounding him is an elaborate oval frame with classical motifs and a coat of arms at the bottom, including two greyhounds and a swan. The background includes decorative engravings and text encircling the figure."
    }
